{"4801040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Murder Squad Y2K", "steam_appid": 4801040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/8566ebe2c5bfbb678f3a38665b1505bc.poster.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/8566ebe2c5bfbb678f3a38665b1505bc.webm?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/8566ebe2c5bfbb678f3a38665b1505bc.mp4?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone thought the Y2K bug was a problem with computers, but it was actually a zombie mind virus triggered by a signal originating from Area 51. Now the whole world is fubar and it's up to you and your ZOMBIE MURDER SQUAD to blast through waves of undead fools and find the source of the zombie signal SO YOU CAN SHUT IT ALL DOWN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> This game is in early development and many things will change before release. Make sure to wishlist and follow the game to keep up with progress and find out about demos and playtests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/a8ab1bbbe714238c4cf23ac0d472d90b.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/c17d39f95b8a4a2b8ed365775f518802.poster.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/c17d39f95b8a4a2b8ed365775f518802.webm?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/c17d39f95b8a4a2b8ed365775f518802.mp4?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill zombies and collect their dropped XP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up for new upgrade possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find upgrades that synergize with eachother for maximum carnage</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/7b20e9d1ea9ad7f19eb862faa766229c.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/77e86a0b53a645aef07968372ec0f80e.poster.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/77e86a0b53a645aef07968372ec0f80e.webm?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/77e86a0b53a645aef07968372ec0f80e.mp4?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you find secrets and complete achievements, you unlock special weapons, items, and characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round starts with 2 soldiers and 3 survivors. But as you upgrade and explore, your squad will grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad aims automatically at the nearest available target. The player controls the movement of the squad leader and the rest of the squad falls in place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera is a third person camera that can be zoomed in or out as the situation demands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some upgrades benefit from synergies with each other that allows the player to maximize their damage output</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/aa26667154133d774446f792ae06aa20.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/e7a24b0a86b312948dd2ee9bcf8b1a7e.poster.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/e7a24b0a86b312948dd2ee9bcf8b1a7e.webm?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/e7a24b0a86b312948dd2ee9bcf8b1a7e.mp4?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you lose all the soldiers in your squad, you lose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you lose all the survivors in your base, you lose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must balance defending and upgrading your base with exploring the area and finding the randomly placed satellite phone to call for rescue.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/83f2740713014c8ea618f8ff4ddfd708.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=98 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet heaven zombie survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro PS1 aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with 2 soldiers in your squad and upgrade to as many as you can during play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up a home base and protect survivors you find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors will repair boarded windows to keep zombies out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map for powerups, secrets, bosses, and a satellite phone to call for extraction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your squad's weapons and stats to become an unstoppable zombie killing force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new levels and advance the story towards 1 of 5 endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/3ed760b187d2fa8f2fd59a91b8fc019a.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Murder Squad Y2K is made by one crazy guy that was alive in the 90s and thought it would be cool to make a game but now it's taken over his life and he's locked in a basement somewhere making games that look like they were made 30 years ago but actually they just came out. He has at least 4 personality disorders and is banned from pretty much every bar in town for various crimes against humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/e7c4a666e0e45b64921e020ed2a1bad3.avif?t=1781792748\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/8566ebe2c5bfbb678f3a38665b1505bc.poster.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/8566ebe2c5bfbb678f3a38665b1505bc.webm?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/8566ebe2c5bfbb678f3a38665b1505bc.mp4?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone thought the Y2K bug was a problem with computers, but it was actually a zombie mind virus triggered by a signal originating from Area 51. Now the whole world is fubar and it's up to you and your ZOMBIE MURDER SQUAD to blast through waves of undead fools and find the source of the zombie signal SO YOU CAN SHUT IT ALL DOWN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> This game is in early development and many things will change before release. Make sure to wishlist and follow the game to keep up with progress and find out about demos and playtests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/a8ab1bbbe714238c4cf23ac0d472d90b.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/c17d39f95b8a4a2b8ed365775f518802.poster.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/c17d39f95b8a4a2b8ed365775f518802.webm?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/c17d39f95b8a4a2b8ed365775f518802.mp4?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill zombies and collect their dropped XP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up for new upgrade possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find upgrades that synergize with eachother for maximum carnage</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/7b20e9d1ea9ad7f19eb862faa766229c.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/77e86a0b53a645aef07968372ec0f80e.poster.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/77e86a0b53a645aef07968372ec0f80e.webm?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/77e86a0b53a645aef07968372ec0f80e.mp4?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you find secrets and complete achievements, you unlock special weapons, items, and characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round starts with 2 soldiers and 3 survivors. But as you upgrade and explore, your squad will grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad aims automatically at the nearest available target. The player controls the movement of the squad leader and the rest of the squad falls in place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera is a third person camera that can be zoomed in or out as the situation demands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some upgrades benefit from synergies with each other that allows the player to maximize their damage output</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/aa26667154133d774446f792ae06aa20.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/e7a24b0a86b312948dd2ee9bcf8b1a7e.poster.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/e7a24b0a86b312948dd2ee9bcf8b1a7e.webm?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/e7a24b0a86b312948dd2ee9bcf8b1a7e.mp4?t=1781792748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you lose all the soldiers in your squad, you lose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you lose all the survivors in your base, you lose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must balance defending and upgrading your base with exploring the area and finding the randomly placed satellite phone to call for rescue.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/83f2740713014c8ea618f8ff4ddfd708.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=98 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet heaven zombie survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro PS1 aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with 2 soldiers in your squad and upgrade to as many as you can during play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up a home base and protect survivors you find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors will repair boarded windows to keep zombies out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map for powerups, secrets, bosses, and a satellite phone to call for extraction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your squad's weapons and stats to become an unstoppable zombie killing force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new levels and advance the story towards 1 of 5 endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/3ed760b187d2fa8f2fd59a91b8fc019a.avif?t=1781792748\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Murder Squad Y2K is made by one crazy guy that was alive in the 90s and thought it would be cool to make a game but now it's taken over his life and he's locked in a basement somewhere making games that look like they were made 30 years ago but actually they just came out. He has at least 4 personality disorders and is banned from pretty much every bar in town for various crimes against humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801040/extras/e7c4a666e0e45b64921e020ed2a1bad3.avif?t=1781792748\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p>", "short_description": "The Y2K bug was real and it turned everyone into zombies! It's up to you and your murder squad to exterminate zombies, grow insanely powerful, and blast your way through a retro PS1 apocalypse to find and destroy the source of the zombie signal.", "su